The trained model weights are too large to be stored directly on GitHub (1.49 GB).  
You can download the `.pth` file from Kaggle:

🔗 [best_model.pth](www.kaggle.com/models/neel7125/best_model)

After downloading, place the file inside the project directory:
Deepfake-Detection
        |
        |----- Code
        |        |-------best_model.pth
        |        |...
        |...

Path : Deepfake Detection/code/best_model.pth
